      <h1 class="page-title max-w-3xl">Technology alliances that deliver.</h1>
      <p>We partner with leading technology vendors to deliver certified, supported infrastructure across the region. Our partnerships mean our clients get the right technology, properly deployed, with vendor-backed support. But our alliances are a means to an end, not an end in itself — we are vendor-independent in our recommendations, and we select the platform that fits your requirements, budget, and regulatory context, not the one that fits our quota.</p>
      <p>Our partner strategy is built on three pillars: technical depth, regional accountability, and operational alignment. We do not list logos on a page for marketing value — every partnership represents a real engineering investment, with certified specialists, tested architectures, and proven delivery models in the markets we serve. We maintain a curated alliance portfolio rather than a long tail of vendors, because depth of expertise matters more than breadth of logos when a production system goes down at 3am.</p>
